    <string name="accessibility_label">HardlySeek voice actions</string>
    <string name="accessibility_description">Turns voice commands like “message someone” into real actions: opens WeChat/QQ, finds the contact, fills in the text, and taps by coordinates when a control cannot be clicked directly. Sending happens only after you confirm. If the service is unavailable, the system share sheet is used and you pick the contact and send manually.</string>
